      "§2 A member shall be able to book a place in a scheduled class.",
      "§2 The system shall not allow a member to hold more than one place in the same class.",
      "§2 When a class is full, the system shall offer a waiting list.",
      "§2 When a place is freed, the system shall offer it to the first member on the waiting list within five minutes.",
      "§3 A member shall be able to cancel a confirmed booking.",
      "§3 If a booking is cancelled within two hours of the class, then the system shall record a late cancellation.",
      "§3 The system must issue a refund through the original payment provider within 24 hours of cancellation.",
      "§4 Staff shall be able to create, move and cancel classes.",
      "§4 The system shall notify every booked member when a class is moved or cancelled.",
      "§1 Scope",
