      "§2 A counter shall be able to start a stock take for one location.",
      "§2 When a counter records a quantity for a product, the system shall save the count with the time and the counter's name.",
      "§2 If a product is counted twice in one stock take, then the system shall keep both counts and flag the product for review.",
      "§2 The system shall not allow a count to be edited;",
      "§3 When a stock take is closed, the system shall show each product where the counted quantity differs from the expected quantity.",
      "§3 The system must let a supervisor accept or reject each variance.",
      "§4 Accepted variances will be exported to the finance system nightly.",
      "§5 Counts must be saved within one second on the warehouse Wi-Fi.",
      "§5 The app must work offline for up to four hours and sync when reconnected.",
